stash.diff

# Style reference sets: image files stay out of version control. This is a
# settled answer, not a pending TODO -- 2026q3_owner_curated/PROVENANCE.md
# records that its source grants commercial use but no explicit right to
# redistribute, and that the shipped crops have the source watermark removed.
# Git keeps whatever is pushed forever, so a set may only be un-ignored once
# its own PROVENANCE.md records redistribution as permitted. PROVENANCE.md is
# tracked; base_character.png predates this rule and is already tracked, so it
# is unaffected.
docs/style_reference/**/*.png
docs/style_reference/**/*.webp
docs/style_reference/**/*.jpg
docs/style_reference/**/*.jpeg
